Subject: [PATCH 5/5] fix(post): Sodick wire post refuses skims by name (#538 x
 #617)

sodick-wire.cps writes its C condition word once, at threading; a skim's
mid-section PARAM EdmCondition only reassigned the variable, so every
skim would have been cut on the rough pass's condition. A condition
change after the section's first cut is now refused by name. Also adds
the skims field to main's sodick_wire_post test literal.

Refs #538

